WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.675
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.675 --> 00:03.344
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION AND
SHAMEFUL ACTS ARE NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:03.344 --> 00:04.970
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:07.097 --> 00:09.850
Honestly, the most amazing
person I've ever met...

00:10.893 --> 00:12.266
is Kitahara-san!

00:17.107 --> 00:19.360
Then you mean Iori...

00:20.444 --> 00:21.779
I'm not sure how to put it.

00:21.779 --> 00:24.156
I'm just a bit
interested in him...

00:32.289 --> 00:35.918
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

00:35.918 --> 00:38.921
Right now is always
the best of the season

00:39.129 --> 00:42.591
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

00:42.675 --> 00:46.136
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

00:46.136 --> 00:49.431
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 2

00:49.473 --> 00:51.559
Ever Endless

00:52.768 --> 00:54.436
Ever Endless

00:56.188 --> 00:57.731
Ever Endless

00:59.608 --> 01:00.985
Ever Endless

01:01.652 --> 01:06.448
Mon-Tues-Weds-Thurs-Fri,
my life knows no variety

01:06.448 --> 01:07.867
Ever Endless

01:08.284 --> 01:13.080
Sat-Sun, wake up in the afternoon
with only my smartphone to surf

01:13.080 --> 01:14.665
Ever Endless

01:14.665 --> 01:16.083
All my limbs' been giving in

01:16.083 --> 01:17.918
Kalbi's a burden
like my lumber spine

01:17.918 --> 01:19.503
Doing family
service with irises dim

01:19.503 --> 01:21.130
But you know that
I'll go all the way

01:21.547 --> 01:24.717
Glitter, shimmer,
the light's shining

01:24.967 --> 01:28.554
Let's give it one more chance

01:28.554 --> 01:32.016
Let's ride out into the
highway of our youth

01:32.224 --> 01:35.019
Right now is always
the best of the season

01:35.227 --> 01:38.856
Get high on hope, as
we adults keep winning

01:38.856 --> 01:41.859
Let's take a dive to explore
an entirely new world

01:42.067 --> 01:44.236
Youth is when you never...

01:44.236 --> 01:45.738
stop chasing your own values

01:45.738 --> 01:47.406
Our youth's eternal

01:47.406 --> 01:48.991
the color never fades with age

01:48.991 --> 01:50.868
Youth is when you keep...

01:50.868 --> 01:52.411
getting lost along the way

01:52.411 --> 01:55.956
Youth is Forever

02:01.921 --> 02:04.006
You mean Chisa and Otoya-kun?

02:04.006 --> 02:04.673
Yup.

02:04.673 --> 02:06.425
They might get
together, you know.

02:07.593 --> 02:08.928
As if.

02:08.928 --> 02:10.888
It's possible, though.

02:11.096 --> 02:14.225
Then let's ask them
when they get back.

02:15.768 --> 02:16.727
Oh, Chisa.

02:19.813 --> 02:20.356
Huh?

02:20.356 --> 02:21.815
I-Is something wrong?

02:22.024 --> 02:23.067
Where's Otoya-kun?

02:25.903 --> 02:27.947
He went to buy some juice.

02:27.947 --> 02:30.157
Oh, I see.

02:30.449 --> 02:31.617
By the way, Chisa.

02:31.617 --> 02:32.159
What?

02:32.409 --> 02:34.537
What did you talk
about with Otoya-kun?

02:36.413 --> 02:37.289
Hmmm?

02:37.540 --> 02:40.417
W-Why do you want to know?

02:40.417 --> 02:43.087
I mean, it took you a
while to come back and all.

02:43.587 --> 02:45.548
So what did you two talk about?

02:46.215 --> 02:47.216
I...

02:48.175 --> 02:50.177
I can't... tell you...

02:50.511 --> 02:52.680
No way!

02:52.847 --> 02:55.474
Oh my, was I actually right?

02:55.474 --> 02:57.893
And here I thought Otoya-kun
came out as a vegan.

02:57.893 --> 03:00.271
He must have fallen for her.

03:00.271 --> 03:03.440
Or maybe there was something
else that made him go for it.

03:04.775 --> 03:07.069
So how do you feel? Shocked?

03:07.069 --> 03:09.196
I am shocked.

03:09.196 --> 03:12.575
But if I had to
describe it, it feels like...

03:12.575 --> 03:13.450
Like what?

03:13.617 --> 03:15.953
Like someone just
confessed to my little sister.

03:16.745 --> 03:18.831
REALLY...?

03:19.665 --> 03:21.917
Are you saying someone
confessed to your girl?!

03:22.084 --> 03:23.043
My girl?

03:23.127 --> 03:24.336
TECHNICALLY HIS GIRL

03:24.795 --> 03:25.880
Seems like it.

03:25.880 --> 03:27.214
How could this happen?

03:27.214 --> 03:29.884
And how are you so
laid back about this?

03:29.884 --> 03:32.428
Huh? What do you mean?
It's none of my business.

03:32.428 --> 03:33.971
Not your business?!

03:33.971 --> 03:35.848
You're directly related to her!

03:35.848 --> 03:37.016
I see.

03:37.308 --> 03:39.643
Kouhei, what you're
trying to say is...

03:40.186 --> 03:42.730
As family, I need to
see if he's worthy of her.

03:42.730 --> 03:45.608
Yeah, if he's not worthy,
you've got to chase him away.

03:45.774 --> 03:49.486
And if he is worthy, I'll
do the manly thing and...

03:49.486 --> 03:51.655
Right, do the manly thing and...

03:52.281 --> 03:53.407
End his life!

03:53.407 --> 03:55.117
Why would you go that far?

03:55.117 --> 03:57.077
I'll get ready to hunt.

03:59.496 --> 04:00.331
I'm back.

04:00.331 --> 04:02.166
Welcome back.

04:04.210 --> 04:06.378
Hey, what's that about?

04:06.795 --> 04:08.047
Who knows.

04:08.297 --> 04:09.715
Seems like they're having fun.

04:09.715 --> 04:10.508
Yup.

04:10.841 --> 04:13.761
They must be happy to talk to
someone with the same hobby.

04:14.094 --> 04:15.179
I see.

04:15.387 --> 04:16.764
Alright, Kitahara.

04:16.764 --> 04:17.640
Huh?

04:18.265 --> 04:19.558
Go get in their way.

04:19.558 --> 04:20.935
Don't be so mean.

04:21.435 --> 04:23.020
What? Is that wrong?

04:23.020 --> 04:24.647
Of course it's wrong.

04:24.939 --> 04:29.693
It's not like I want to get in
Naomi-kun's way when he's having fun.

04:29.693 --> 04:31.904
Then just sit still.

04:32.029 --> 04:33.113
But you know,

04:33.531 --> 04:35.741
to me, this isn't
something I can give up on.

04:36.367 --> 04:37.535
Oh...

04:37.993 --> 04:38.827
What is it?

04:39.161 --> 04:40.496
It's nothing.

04:41.080 --> 04:43.666
You seriously like
Otoya-kun, huh?

04:43.666 --> 04:44.875
Yes, I do.

04:45.000 --> 04:46.043
I seriously...

04:46.210 --> 04:48.003
I seriously like his face.

04:48.003 --> 04:50.798
Going that far is pretty
impressive, Busujima-sama.

04:51.590 --> 04:54.677
I won't meddle directly,
but I'll lend you a hand.

04:54.677 --> 04:55.761
What are you gonna do?

04:55.761 --> 04:59.306
I'll make sure they never
grow feelings for each other.

04:59.598 --> 05:02.226
He said he was
interested in Iori...

05:02.685 --> 05:04.728
But what's there to like?

05:05.104 --> 05:06.897
What's wrong, Chisa-san?

05:07.439 --> 05:09.733
I have a bit of a
strange question.

05:09.733 --> 05:10.901
Yes, go ahead.

05:11.527 --> 05:14.697
What type of
person are you into?

05:14.947 --> 05:16.490
Let's see...

05:16.490 --> 05:20.494
I have a small appetite, so I like
someone who can eat and drink a lot.

05:21.120 --> 05:22.663
Someone who can casually...

05:22.663 --> 05:25.207
play the guitar after
getting out of the ocean.

05:26.417 --> 05:27.835
Kitahara-san!

05:28.836 --> 05:30.045
Come with me for a sec.

05:30.045 --> 05:31.213
Huh? What?

05:32.882 --> 05:34.216
What are you doing?

05:34.383 --> 05:35.968
Even if you ask me that...

05:35.968 --> 05:39.763
Is she upset that her time with
Otoya-kun is being interrupted?

05:39.763 --> 05:41.640
Otoya-kun said...

05:41.640 --> 05:44.018
- that he's interested in you -
Which means that Chisa must like...

05:44.018 --> 05:45.269
That's not so bad.

05:46.854 --> 05:48.439
Not so bad?

05:48.439 --> 05:50.107
Which means Iori is...

05:50.524 --> 05:51.817
Iori is...

05:53.694 --> 05:57.740
But he looks at big sister and Azusa-san's
breasts with such perverted eyes.

05:57.990 --> 06:00.326
But he didn't do anything
to me that one time.

06:01.285 --> 06:03.287
It's too hard to
ask him directly.

06:03.287 --> 06:06.165
I need to find some other
way to determine the truth.

06:06.373 --> 06:08.000
Why is she being so quiet?

06:08.500 --> 06:11.337
I thought she would
scold me for disturbing her.

06:12.087 --> 06:15.508
Almost like she's trying to
start a difficult conversation.

06:16.008 --> 06:19.553
Is she going to
break up with me?

06:20.221 --> 06:23.307
Technically, I'm her boyfriend.

06:23.474 --> 06:26.185
If she wants to date
Otoya, she must settle this.

06:26.477 --> 06:27.478
But what is this?

06:27.811 --> 06:30.147
This dissatisfied feeling?!

06:30.606 --> 06:33.567
Thinking back, I neither gave
nor received a confession.

06:33.817 --> 06:36.529
We never held hands or
went anywhere with just us two.

06:36.695 --> 06:37.988
Even without any of that,

06:38.155 --> 06:41.408
it's still as awkward as a
breakup between real couple.

06:42.368 --> 06:43.827
There's no helping it.

06:44.119 --> 06:46.330
If that's what Chisa wants...

06:47.039 --> 06:48.165
Hey, Iori.

06:48.374 --> 06:49.917
Ah, yeah?

06:50.417 --> 06:52.127
Iori, do you really...

06:53.504 --> 06:55.005
love boobs?

07:00.594 --> 07:02.096
What did she just ask?

07:03.013 --> 07:04.723
"Do you love boobs?"

07:04.974 --> 07:06.559
Of course I do.

07:06.559 --> 07:08.686
I want to meet the
man who doesn't.

07:08.894 --> 07:09.603
But...

07:09.770 --> 07:12.231
Do you really love boobs?

07:12.231 --> 07:13.899
What's with that "really?"

07:14.316 --> 07:16.569
What the hell is she doubting?

07:16.986 --> 07:17.903
Well?

07:18.404 --> 07:19.280
Well what?

07:19.989 --> 07:21.156
AFFIRM Of course I love them.

07:21.156 --> 07:22.449
AFFIRM Pervert!
You're the worst!

07:22.908 --> 07:24.285
DENY Actually, I don't.

07:24.285 --> 07:25.828
DENY Liar! You're the worst!

07:26.537 --> 07:27.746
BEING CONSIDERATE
Small ones are cute too.

07:27.746 --> 07:29.206
BEING CONSIDERATE
Just answer the question!

07:29.540 --> 07:30.291
It's no use.

07:30.457 --> 07:32.626
No matter how I answer,
it's gonna go badly.

07:32.877 --> 07:33.627
No wait!

07:33.627 --> 07:35.629
I haven't put enough
thought into it!

07:36.755 --> 07:37.548
Think!

07:37.548 --> 07:39.300
Sink into the seas of thought!

07:39.717 --> 07:42.094
The best answer
to this question is...

07:44.138 --> 07:44.889
I...

07:46.390 --> 07:48.767
I only love the...

07:49.435 --> 07:50.227
right boob.

07:52.605 --> 07:54.148
What does that mean?

07:54.148 --> 07:56.567
Huh? What? Is that a thing?

07:57.067 --> 08:00.237
Do people really feel differently
about left and right boob?

08:01.280 --> 08:05.284
I just wanted to know
how he feels about women.

08:05.284 --> 08:06.744
Why does this idiot have to...

08:06.744 --> 08:08.871
say things that aren't
making any sense!

08:09.079 --> 08:11.207
That's my line!

08:11.707 --> 08:14.376
Enough, I'll just
ask Shiori-chan.

08:14.376 --> 08:15.711
Wait, wait, wait.

08:17.046 --> 08:19.131
Are you calling Shiori-chan?

08:19.757 --> 08:21.258
I'm glad I made it in time.

08:21.258 --> 08:22.218
- For what?
- For what?

08:27.598 --> 08:29.517
Is watching this fun?

08:29.767 --> 08:30.684
Yes.

08:30.976 --> 08:34.980
All I see is a bunch of idiots.

08:36.315 --> 08:39.026
I think it's that everyone
is being themselves.

08:39.276 --> 08:42.905
Kitahara seems to be a bad
influence on everyone, doesn't he?

08:43.197 --> 08:45.115
A bad influence?

08:45.241 --> 08:49.119
Even I have times when I
say rude things because of him.

08:49.995 --> 08:51.413
But Sakurako-san,

08:51.413 --> 08:54.291
you seemed much livelier
since Kitahara-san came.

08:54.583 --> 08:55.167
Huh?

08:55.334 --> 08:58.921
Y-You must be mistaken.

08:58.921 --> 09:00.047
Really?

09:00.714 --> 09:04.051
I think Kitahara-san
is surprisingly nice.

09:04.426 --> 09:07.179
Even if I don't
hold anything back,

09:07.179 --> 09:10.015
and let it all go, I feel
like he'd still accept me.

09:10.808 --> 09:13.018
He's fine the way he is.

09:14.436 --> 09:18.816
Well, everyone has at least
one thing that they're good at.

09:19.817 --> 09:21.026
That's true.

09:21.610 --> 09:23.821
I really like someone like that.

09:24.864 --> 09:25.531
Huh?

09:25.906 --> 09:28.325
Naomi-kun, can I
ask you something?

09:28.617 --> 09:29.159
Yes.

09:29.410 --> 09:31.287
That's Hamaoka-san
over there, right?

09:31.287 --> 09:32.621
Indeed.

09:32.955 --> 09:34.957
What do you think of her?

09:35.249 --> 09:37.126
I think she's very beautiful.

09:37.126 --> 09:39.128
What about the
instructor's little sister?

09:40.045 --> 09:42.256
I think she's very cute.

09:42.756 --> 09:43.757
What about Kitahara?

09:45.926 --> 09:49.096
I think he's... wonderful.

09:51.015 --> 09:51.724
Kitahara.

09:52.850 --> 09:54.226
I can't tell you why,

09:54.226 --> 09:57.897
but I'll be bullying you
thrice as hard from now on.

09:58.397 --> 10:01.400
What the hell happened
while I was gone?

10:04.278 --> 10:05.779
Kitahara-san, Kitahara-san.

10:05.779 --> 10:08.157
I made lunch,
let's eat together.

10:08.365 --> 10:10.159
Kitahara-san, Kitahara-san.

10:10.451 --> 10:12.328
Kitahara-san, Kitahara-san.

10:12.620 --> 10:14.330
Kitahara-san, Kitahara-san.

10:14.330 --> 10:15.331
CHANGING ROOM

10:15.956 --> 10:17.458
Kitahara.

10:17.917 --> 10:19.960
What is it, Busujima-sama?

10:20.586 --> 10:22.338
You're ugly, go kill yourself!

10:22.796 --> 10:25.007
Hold up, I don't get
what you're saying.

10:25.508 --> 10:26.884
But quit taking it out on me.

10:27.009 --> 10:28.677
Taking it out on you?

10:28.677 --> 10:30.179
TO PUNISH OR HURT SOMEONE WHEN ONE IS
UPSET, EVEN THOUGH IT IS NOT THEIR FAULT

10:30.179 --> 10:31.805
Kitahara-san.

10:32.556 --> 10:35.184
It is your fault,
so it's all good.

10:35.184 --> 10:36.477
How come?!

10:37.561 --> 10:40.731
Why would Naomi-kun
like a guy like that?

10:41.148 --> 10:44.610
But one thing's for sure,
Naomi-kun likes this idiot.

10:45.069 --> 10:47.029
Hypothetically speaking.

10:47.029 --> 10:48.280
Oh, what is it?

10:48.781 --> 10:51.617
If you were trying to woo
Naomi-kun, how would you do it?

10:51.825 --> 10:52.826
Huh?

10:52.826 --> 10:54.370
How would I know?

10:54.370 --> 10:56.914
Then what about
some random girl?

10:56.914 --> 10:58.958
Oh, let's see...

10:59.208 --> 11:01.794
I would approach her directly.

11:02.127 --> 11:04.088
A direct approach huh...

11:04.797 --> 11:08.133
I'm kinda awkward, so I
don't know how to express it.

11:08.634 --> 11:10.678
But these feelings are real.

11:10.886 --> 11:13.347
And I want to tell you
how I honestly feel.

11:14.139 --> 11:15.599
I would love to fuck you.

11:16.684 --> 11:17.810
You scumbag.

11:17.810 --> 11:19.937
What kind of confession
are you imagining?

11:19.937 --> 11:21.689
No wonder you're still a virgin.

11:21.689 --> 11:22.731
Huh?

11:22.940 --> 11:25.401
How - proves - I'm virgin?

11:25.401 --> 11:27.570
Your grammar's
all over the place.

11:29.446 --> 11:31.198
What would you do then?

11:31.198 --> 11:32.074
Me?

11:32.324 --> 11:35.244
Of course, I'd use
my specialty weapon.

11:35.244 --> 11:37.621
Hoho. So that means...

11:38.247 --> 11:40.165
Hey, Naomi.

11:40.165 --> 11:40.708
Yes.

11:41.000 --> 11:43.836
I think I might be drunk.

11:43.878 --> 11:45.838
Let's hurry home then!

11:45.838 --> 11:48.507
No, I mean let's rest somewhe...

11:48.507 --> 11:50.634
The trains are
about to stop running!

11:50.634 --> 11:51.969
We've gotta hurry.

11:57.391 --> 11:59.727
Those kinds of
weapons are illegal.

11:59.727 --> 12:02.188
What part of a woman's
weapons are illegal?

12:02.438 --> 12:04.315
A woman's weapons, eh?

12:04.315 --> 12:05.357
What is it?

12:05.357 --> 12:08.527
Yours had absolutely
no effect last time.

12:09.236 --> 12:12.948
It's true that Naomi-kun isn't
interested in a woman's weapons.

12:13.699 --> 12:15.701
Then what should I do?

12:15.701 --> 12:16.827
Why are you asking me?

12:16.827 --> 12:18.579
Just think of
something, anything.

12:18.579 --> 12:21.081
If it goes well, I'll hook you
up with one of my friends.

12:21.081 --> 12:22.124
Oh!

12:22.750 --> 12:25.127
I will do my best!

12:25.127 --> 12:26.045
FOR YOU!

12:26.045 --> 12:28.130
Don't overload from
all the excitement.

12:29.215 --> 12:31.759
Well, let's discuss
strategy later.

12:31.759 --> 12:34.386
Okay, let's meet up after work.

12:34.887 --> 12:36.305
Are you guys going somewhere?

12:37.515 --> 12:38.766
Well...

12:38.766 --> 12:41.769
this idiot insisted
on going for a drink.

12:42.144 --> 12:44.230
With you, Sakurako-san?

12:45.231 --> 12:47.107
What is this, a punishment game?

12:47.399 --> 12:49.068
It's nothing special.

12:49.068 --> 12:51.237
He's just going to
show me a good bar.

12:51.529 --> 12:53.989
It'd be great if you
could come along as well.

12:53.989 --> 12:55.866
Well, I'm still in
high school, after all.

12:56.325 --> 12:59.286
But I'm glad you two
are getting along now.

12:59.286 --> 13:01.664
No, we're really not.

13:01.997 --> 13:05.501
What a pity that I can't
go with you, Kitahara-san.

13:05.876 --> 13:08.170
Please bring me along next time!

13:09.171 --> 13:10.256
Understood.

13:10.589 --> 13:11.465
See ya.

13:13.717 --> 13:14.885
But why?

13:16.262 --> 13:18.264
So? Any bright ideas?

13:18.430 --> 13:19.682
None at all.

13:19.682 --> 13:21.350
What a useless man.

13:21.976 --> 13:24.854
That's why I've
invited some advisors.

13:24.854 --> 13:25.980
Advisors?

13:26.188 --> 13:27.064
A hottie!

13:27.189 --> 13:28.065
A bartender!

13:28.148 --> 13:29.275
A guy with girlfriend!

13:29.608 --> 13:32.027
They're all experts
in their field.

13:32.278 --> 13:34.405
They don't look
that way to me at all.

13:34.738 --> 13:37.491
Are these guys really
going to be of any use?

13:37.491 --> 13:38.951
You don't believe them?

13:38.951 --> 13:39.994
Not one bit.

13:39.994 --> 13:41.036
I see.

13:41.120 --> 13:42.788
Then think of it this way.

13:43.080 --> 13:45.749
Put your faith in the one
who recommended them.

13:45.749 --> 13:47.418
Would you guys get lost?

13:47.418 --> 13:49.295
Hey!

13:49.295 --> 13:53.465
Why didn't you call the
most reliable person?

13:53.465 --> 13:54.800
You mean Azusa-san?

13:55.009 --> 13:57.469
She's busy, so she can't come.

13:57.761 --> 13:59.889
Sorry, it's a girls' thing.

14:00.097 --> 14:01.891
You useless man!

14:02.516 --> 14:04.435
Why?

14:07.688 --> 14:08.397
So...

14:08.856 --> 14:10.608
what kind of advice
do you need...

14:11.066 --> 14:11.901
Aina?

14:14.987 --> 14:18.824
He said he likes people
that can eat and drink heartily.

14:18.824 --> 14:19.867
And also people...

14:19.867 --> 14:23.787
who can casually play the guitar
after getting out of the ocean.

14:23.787 --> 14:25.247
Just because he said that...

14:25.247 --> 14:27.750
doesn't mean he wants
someone who can do those things.

14:27.750 --> 14:31.086
But rather someone who
gives off that kind of vibe.

14:31.545 --> 14:36.217
Basically, a soft older
person in tune with the ocean.

14:36.217 --> 14:38.177
No need to physically
do any of tha...

14:38.177 --> 14:39.762
Oh, Busujima-sama.

14:40.930 --> 14:43.182
I suppose I'll go ahead
and ask, what is that?

14:43.182 --> 14:45.309
Huh? Can't you tell by looking?

14:45.726 --> 14:48.437
Show off how you just got out
of the ocean with the wetsuit.

14:48.896 --> 14:50.648
Begin to leisurely
strum on your guitar.

14:50.648 --> 14:52.358
And put on a hearty chugging.

14:52.650 --> 14:54.318
Fall in love!

14:58.364 --> 14:59.949
Hurry up and stick out your ass.

14:59.949 --> 15:02.326
If you don't like it,
you can just say so!

15:02.326 --> 15:05.371
No good, trash, useless, garbage,
worse than ripped stockings.

15:05.371 --> 15:07.248
The first two words
would've been enough...

15:07.957 --> 15:09.750
You won't know
unless you try, right?

15:09.750 --> 15:11.460
Then go try it.

15:11.460 --> 15:13.212
Fine! Watch me!

15:15.047 --> 15:16.507
Um, Sakurako-san.

15:16.507 --> 15:18.425
Good morning, Naomi-kun.

15:18.884 --> 15:21.679
Kitahara-san must have
bumped his head really hard.

15:21.679 --> 15:24.014
That idiot really did it.

15:24.181 --> 15:27.977
So I'll be sure to
carefully look after him.

15:30.437 --> 15:32.857
Naomi-kun, there aren't
any customers so I came to...

15:32.857 --> 15:34.358
Does your head hurt?

15:34.358 --> 15:35.234
Huh?

15:35.234 --> 15:37.987
Naomi-kun, it's quiet at the
moment, let's take a break.

15:37.987 --> 15:39.446
Do you have a fever?

15:39.446 --> 15:39.905
Huh?

15:40.030 --> 15:42.950
- Naomi-kun...
- Dizzy? Numbness in your arms or legs?

15:43.200 --> 15:44.702
Let me take you home.

15:44.702 --> 15:45.536
Huh?

15:45.661 --> 15:48.247
Why does it go so
smoothly for you?

15:48.247 --> 15:49.540
What are you saying?

15:49.540 --> 15:51.250
Big order coming through!

15:51.917 --> 15:54.336
Otoya-kun, can you
handle this many orders?

15:54.545 --> 15:56.130
No problem, I can do it.

16:20.738 --> 16:22.198
Welcome.

16:22.198 --> 16:24.867
Yo, yo, you're really
doing it, Sakurako.

16:24.867 --> 16:25.910
Yahoo.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.745
What happened to you two?

16:27.745 --> 16:29.872
We were drinking nearby,

16:29.872 --> 16:32.458
it's like a zoo so
we slipped away.

16:33.417 --> 16:33.918
So...

16:34.335 --> 16:35.336
where's that kid?

16:36.337 --> 16:37.630
Wow, I knew it.

16:37.630 --> 16:39.715
Did you come here
to see Naomi-kun?

16:39.715 --> 16:40.799
It's fine, isn't it?

16:40.799 --> 16:42.635
Let us bleach our eyes.

16:42.635 --> 16:45.137
I'll show you when
he's my boyfriend.

16:45.137 --> 16:46.931
Huh? That again?

16:47.306 --> 16:49.767
That's not like you at all.

16:49.767 --> 16:50.935
That's right.

16:50.935 --> 16:51.810
What do you mean?

16:51.810 --> 16:56.440
I mean you're the type that
snoops in and nabs them.

16:56.649 --> 16:58.150
This time is special.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.610
There you go again.

16:59.610 --> 17:01.737
Acting all like a maiden.

17:01.737 --> 17:03.447
Just be yourself.

17:03.697 --> 17:05.241
Be myself...

17:05.241 --> 17:06.951
That's right, I mean...

17:07.117 --> 17:09.286
you only like him
for his face, right?

17:10.037 --> 17:12.081
The one type hotties
hate the most is...

17:12.081 --> 17:13.707
needy girls.

17:13.707 --> 17:17.127
That's why it should be
easy for you, Sakurako.

17:17.127 --> 17:20.339
You're not needy, have a
nice body, and a pretty face.

17:20.548 --> 17:23.676
Besides, you're the
only one who's still single.

17:23.676 --> 17:27.137
Hurry up and find one so
we can enjoy the summer.

17:27.388 --> 17:30.057
Easy for me... huh.

17:30.724 --> 17:33.644
Then I'll go right
now. Wait right here.

17:34.812 --> 17:36.522
That's our Sakurako.

17:38.065 --> 17:41.026
Kitahara-kun, it's about
time for your break.

17:41.318 --> 17:42.611
Roger that.

17:42.778 --> 17:44.905
Naomi-kun, do you have a moment?

17:44.905 --> 17:45.656
Yes?

17:46.031 --> 17:48.367
Do you need something,
Sakurako-san?

17:48.868 --> 17:51.328
I guess you could say that.

17:51.954 --> 17:54.665
Didn't you say that you don't
have a girlfriend right now?

17:54.665 --> 17:55.291
Uh...

17:55.958 --> 17:57.751
I don't but...

17:58.002 --> 17:59.378
That's great.

17:59.587 --> 18:01.297
The thing is I...

18:01.297 --> 18:02.631
If you don't have
a girlfriend...

18:05.551 --> 18:06.677
would you date...

18:13.392 --> 18:15.060
Oh, she's back!

18:15.060 --> 18:16.270
How was it?

18:16.645 --> 18:17.897
It didn't work out.

18:18.230 --> 18:19.064
Oh dear.

18:19.064 --> 18:20.274
That's too bad.

18:21.275 --> 18:23.360
But don't you feel refreshed?

18:23.694 --> 18:24.695
That's right.

18:24.778 --> 18:26.947
After all, you only
liked him for his face.

18:26.947 --> 18:29.617
You can easily find
someone else right away.

18:31.202 --> 18:33.746
Well, that's true.

18:33.746 --> 18:34.955
Right?

18:35.164 --> 18:36.123
Ah well.

18:36.123 --> 18:38.209
Looks like I'll have
to start looking again!

18:38.209 --> 18:40.169
That's it! That instant shift!

18:40.169 --> 18:41.587
That's our Sakurako!

18:41.712 --> 18:42.796
Of course.

18:42.796 --> 18:45.049
Being clingy isn't
really in my character.

18:45.049 --> 18:46.050
That's right.

18:46.050 --> 18:47.051
It's true.

18:47.051 --> 18:49.678
After all, the reason you
liked him was just that.

18:49.678 --> 18:51.430
Maybe you couldn't
get serious about him?

18:52.097 --> 18:53.307
That's it.

18:53.516 --> 18:55.768
I could have done
it if I'd been serious.

18:55.768 --> 18:57.895
Then it's your fault
for not being that.

18:57.895 --> 19:00.105
That's such an
awful way to put it!

19:04.652 --> 19:06.237
Good work today!

19:09.114 --> 19:09.698
Here.

19:12.117 --> 19:13.077
What's this?

19:13.077 --> 19:14.662
I thought you'd want a drink.

19:15.329 --> 19:16.539
So you know.

19:16.747 --> 19:18.916
I just happened to
overhear it from the hallway.

19:19.166 --> 19:20.042
I see.

19:20.417 --> 19:22.920
So what? Are you
trying to comfort me?

19:23.087 --> 19:24.672
Yeah, pretty much.

19:26.757 --> 19:30.177
This isn't anything
to get depressed over.

19:30.177 --> 19:31.387
Is that so?

19:31.470 --> 19:33.639
I mean it's no big deal.

19:34.431 --> 19:37.351
I just got rejected by
someone whose face I liked.

19:38.352 --> 19:39.645
What's with that face?

19:39.645 --> 19:40.896
Nothing.

19:41.105 --> 19:44.024
I'm not really sure that's
reason to not be down about it.

19:44.149 --> 19:46.277
Huh? Of course it is.

19:46.277 --> 19:48.070
There should be
a better reason...

19:48.070 --> 19:49.780
But you said it
yourself, didn't you?

19:50.447 --> 19:51.907
That you seriously like him.

19:52.575 --> 19:54.326
I'm telling you that
was about his face!

19:54.326 --> 19:55.786
So what?

19:56.287 --> 19:58.455
What's wrong with
seriously liking a face?

20:00.165 --> 20:02.209
Everyone has their
own preferences.

20:02.585 --> 20:04.795
It doesn't matter what
people around you say.

20:05.588 --> 20:06.547
Am I wrong?

20:12.887 --> 20:13.846
Kitahara...

20:13.846 --> 20:15.306
Huh? Yeah...

20:16.557 --> 20:19.059
Don't talk like you understand.

20:20.186 --> 20:20.811
So what?

20:20.811 --> 20:24.148
Do you think I'll start crying
and clinging to your chest?

20:24.148 --> 20:25.524
Were you expecting something?

20:27.067 --> 20:28.152
You know...

20:28.152 --> 20:29.445
To begin with,

20:29.445 --> 20:32.239
who uses beer to comfort a girl?

20:33.699 --> 20:34.867
My bad.

20:35.075 --> 20:36.577
If you really mean that...

20:37.077 --> 20:39.038
then go buy me something else.

20:39.788 --> 20:41.665
Jeez.

20:42.917 --> 20:44.835
So what were you hoping would...

20:46.462 --> 20:47.755
Don't turn this way.

20:48.797 --> 20:51.050
Who would cling
to your damn chest?

20:52.760 --> 20:53.511
Idiot.

21:00.017 --> 21:01.602
Good morning, Naomi-kun.

21:02.937 --> 21:04.855
Ah, good morning.

21:05.189 --> 21:07.358
Don't worry about yesterday.

21:08.275 --> 21:09.401
I understand.

21:09.485 --> 21:10.736
Ah, but...

21:10.778 --> 21:11.487
Yes?

21:11.487 --> 21:14.365
If you ever change your
mind, just let me know.

21:16.367 --> 21:18.410
Understood, I'll
be sure to do so.

21:18.410 --> 21:21.247
If I'm also available
then, let's go out.

21:22.831 --> 21:24.416
Hey, you look fine.

21:24.416 --> 21:26.418
I told you I wasn't depressed.

21:27.044 --> 21:30.005
So forget about last night.

21:30.548 --> 21:31.340
Roger.

21:32.550 --> 21:33.717
Ahh, also...

21:34.051 --> 21:36.345
pass this to Kouhei-kun for me.

21:37.429 --> 21:39.014
Huh? What are these?

21:39.014 --> 21:39.765
KAYA MIZUKI - OUMI FESTIVAL RESERVED
TICKET - CUTIE MAID LALAKO-TAN

21:39.765 --> 21:41.517
Is this an apology for before?

21:41.517 --> 21:42.351
Who knows.

21:42.768 --> 21:44.436
Pass them to him yourself.

21:44.436 --> 21:46.355
No way, so gross.

21:47.815 --> 21:49.608
You aren't being honest at all.

21:56.657 --> 21:58.367
ARE YOU FREE NEXT SATURDAY?

21:58.659 --> 22:00.619
Just the usual drinking party.

22:02.621 --> 22:03.789
YOU WANNA GO TO
THE MOVIE THEATER?

22:05.875 --> 22:08.586
Have you told Chisa and Kouhei?

22:11.422 --> 22:12.715
THAT'S NOT IT

22:12.715 --> 22:14.967
I MEANT JUST THE TWO OF US

22:21.682 --> 22:23.225
Wanna talk to you,
wanna talk to you

22:23.225 --> 22:25.102
First I gotta know all
about you, isn't that right?

22:25.102 --> 22:27.062
Ending it off at round
one reeks of boredom

22:27.062 --> 22:28.814
Rounds two, three,
and four is the plan

22:28.814 --> 22:30.524
As the night gets deeper,
true thoughts escape

22:30.524 --> 22:32.443
Let us go on and on
and dive down late

22:32.443 --> 22:35.446
Your history, your scenery, for
me will your pages get slippery

22:35.446 --> 22:37.489
Hey, show me even more

22:37.489 --> 22:39.241
This is my track and
you are the featured guest

22:39.241 --> 22:40.826
We'll forget by the
time when the dawn hits

22:40.826 --> 22:42.286
Being incomplete is perfection

22:42.286 --> 22:44.538
Hey, show me even more

22:44.538 --> 22:46.123
My mouth keeps slipping,
my mouth keeps slipping

22:46.123 --> 22:47.750
Complaint whether
we sober upward

22:47.750 --> 22:49.793
For now, let's ride
high on this feeling

22:50.169 --> 22:56.217
Let's live this moment with all we
can without leaving a single regret,

22:56.717 --> 22:58.427
We are gonna do it,
we go past the limit now

22:58.427 --> 23:00.054
Not just the whole night,
party till the sun is out

23:00.054 --> 23:02.223
Let's fly high

23:02.223 --> 23:02.806
(Let's fly high)

23:02.806 --> 23:04.808
So first, you just strip it down

23:04.808 --> 23:07.102
An exposed and
feral kind of bond

23:07.102 --> 23:10.731
It's the way of life's cycle,
let us go way beyond

23:10.731 --> 23:12.358
The very moment that
we met I drop my shy act

23:12.358 --> 23:14.109
I wanna bare it all and
say what I need to say

23:14.109 --> 23:16.111
Do it now...

23:16.904 --> 23:21.200
This is the magic spell that breaks
down each and every single wall

23:21.200 --> 23:24.662
And once you get used to
it, you won't feel a thing at all

23:24.662 --> 23:26.163
Being without clothes
is a mystery I live in

23:26.163 --> 23:27.915
The drinking and chatting
is flowing more freely

23:27.915 --> 23:30.292
Try it now...

23:30.709 --> 23:34.213
And right before you
realize what's going on

23:34.213 --> 23:38.425
Your heart will catch
right up and finally be free

23:44.932 --> 23:49.937
NEXT TIME: THE MOVIE DATE
